  "genre": "reverseHarem",
  "hook": "My father is a senator from Massachusetts. I am twenty-six and a medical resident at Georgetown University Hospital. The first letter arrived in February. The ninth letter was a photograph of me sleeping. My father assigned three bodyguards. Glen was a former SEAL, Kenta was a former Secret Service, and Matt was the one who never took his eyes off the door. They moved into my apartment. They took shifts. One kissed me three weeks in. The second one watched. The third one said, *it was always going to be all three of us, Briar, or it wasn't going to be any of us.*",
